    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f <strong>Classic Platforming Action</strong> \u2013 Experience tight, responsive controls and fast-paced gameplay inspired by retro platformers. <br>\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Four Distinct Worlds</strong> \u2013 Explore vibrant forests, dark caves, snow-covered lands, and shadowy caverns, each filled with unique enemies and obstacles.<br>\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Dynamic Combat &amp; Power-Ups</strong> \u2013 Attack enemies, dodge hazards, and collect special abilities like health boosts, shields, and shooting powers.<br>\ud83c\udfae <strong>50 Challenging Levels</strong> \u2013 Progress through increasingly difficult stages that test your reflexes and strategy.<br>\ud83d\udc55 <strong>Unlockable Skins</strong> \u2013 Customize Retro\u2019s appearance with a variety of stylish outfits.<br>\ud83d\udc8e <strong>Coin Collection &amp; Upgrades</strong> \u2013 Gather coins to unlock new skins and power-ups to enhance your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a thrilling platforming challenge where every jump, enemy, and obstacle pushes your skills to the limit. Can you guide Retro to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now and get ready to embark on an epic adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
